{
  "version": "0.1-placeholder",
  "notes": "PLACEHOLDER config drawn from the physics seen in the partial mining run (mining/SIGNATURES.md, dev cohort, destructive_wind only had enough events) and the anchor-window checks. Every threshold here is a starting point for tune.py, not a tuned value. The tornado rule in particular is a provisional favorable-conditions proxy (ERA5 has no CAPE); signature mining will refine which features and thresholds carry signal.",
